.Dd November 7, 2026
.Dt LOCATE.CODE 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm locate.code ,
.Nm locate.bigram
.Nd build the locate database
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm locate.bigram
.Nm locate.code
.Ar common_bigrams
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm locate.bigram
reads a sorted list of path names on standard input.
For each name it counts the pairs of characters, two at a time, after the part it shares with the name before it.
It writes each printable pair with its count on standard output.
.Pp
.Nm locate.code
reads the same list on standard input.
It writes the compressed database on standard output.
It uses the most frequent pairs, read from the file
.Ar common_bigrams .
.Pp
.Xr locate.updatedb 8
runs both through
.Pa /usr/libexec/locate.mklocatedb .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr locate 1 ,
.Xr locate.updatedb 8
